      "statement": "roundEngine wraps publishRoundSummary in an additional 3s outer guard (PUBLISH_SUMMARY_OUTER_TIMEOUT_MS) so a Supabase hang cannot pin the round pipeline, and publishes the follow-up state broadcast fire-and-forget on game over.",
