    {
      "id": "claim_95eaf7b8c4c24e5092ba59578f76fe4d",
      "statement": "When subscribed with a presenceKey, the match channel tracks the local player's presence and reports a peer's presence 'leave' via onOpponentLeave, filtering out self-leaves so consumers only see opponent disconnects.",
